N('Düzelt: Had I known, I will have called.','Had I known, I would have called.','Üçüncü koşulda sonuç would have + V3.',{'If I had known, I will have called.': 'Sonuç kısmında will have kullanılmaz.', 'Had I known, I would called.': 'would have + V3 eksik.'}),
